{"id":"ca489e8e614e025a","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-site-cover-forcing.md","title":"Theorem — 站点覆盖下的存在与析取强制","display":"Theorem — 站点覆盖下的存在与析取强制","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-site-cover-forcing","aliases":["14-thm-site-cover-forcing"],"display":"Theorem — 站点覆盖下的存在与析取强制","depends_on":["[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]","[[14-thm-yoneda-lemma]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]]","[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]]","[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","[[14-df-small-site]]","[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","[[14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing]]","[[14-thm-kripke-joyal-forcing-rules]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-site-cover-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-site-cover-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 站点覆盖下的存在与析取强制"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1291f8efcdef81cf\" href=\"?note=1291f8efcdef81cf\" title=\"14-thm-yoneda-lemma\">14-thm-yoneda-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93ae791420c1822a\" href=\"?note=93ae791420c1822a\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective\">14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"93c6dd137bf8628e\" href=\"?note=93c6dd137bf8628e\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits\">14-df-presheaf-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5036bba7ca747e71\" href=\"?note=5036bba7ca747e71\" title=\"14-df-small-site\">14-df-small-site</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"eeccd7d0ab927af1\" href=\"?note=eeccd7d0ab927af1\" title=\"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing\">14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2244a38da8fc05f8\" href=\"?note=2244a38da8fc05f8\" title=\"14-thm-kripke-joyal-forcing-rules\">14-thm-kripke-joyal-forcing-rules</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E=\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\(\\mathcal E=\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i:\\mathcal E\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\">\\(i:\\mathcal E\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为满包含。选取满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 的数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a> 的 Yoneda 函子，Yoneda 对应采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"1291f8efcdef81cf\" href=\"?note=1291f8efcdef81cf\" title=\"14-thm-yoneda-lemma\">14-thm-yoneda-lemma</a>。层的有限积采用逐点积，终层逐点为固定单元素集；这是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"93c6dd137bf8628e\" href=\"?note=93c6dd137bf8628e\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits\">14-df-presheaf-finite-limits</a> 的构造在层上的限制。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a> 的签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 中的结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in M_{\\vec x}(C)\">\\(\\alpha\\in M_{\\vec x}(C)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\)</span>；量词式另取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in S_0\">\\(s\\in S_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{x\\}\\)</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_{(\\vec x,x)}(D)=M_{\\vec x}(D)\\times M_s(D)\">\\(M_{(\\vec x,x)}(D)=M_{\\vec x}(D)\\times M_s(D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stage}_{C,A}\">\\(\\operatorname{Stage}_{C,A}\\)</span> 的输入为层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 及截面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in A(C)\">\\(b\\in A(C)\\)</span>。强制缩写中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec z\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\">\\(\\vec z\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\">\\(\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Form}(S)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\chi)\\subseteq|\\vec z|_{\\mathrm{var}}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\chi)\\subseteq|\\vec z|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in M_{\\vec z}(C)\">\\(\\beta\\in M_{\\vec z}(C)\\)</span>；限制记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta|_f\">\\(\\beta|_f\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\">\\(f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\)</span> 时使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall b\\in A(C)\\ \\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(a(yC),A)\\quad(i(h)\\circ\\eta_{yC})_C(\\operatorname{id}_C)=b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall b\\in A(C)\\ \\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(a(yC),A)\\quad(i(h)\\circ\\eta_{yC})_C(\\operatorname{id}_C)=b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell C:=a(yC),\\qquad\\operatorname{Stage}_{C,A}(b):=\\iota h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\ell C,A)\\quad\\bigl((i(h)\\circ\\eta_{yC})_C(\\operatorname{id}_C)=b\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell C:=a(yC),\\qquad\\operatorname{Stage}_{C,A}(b):=\\iota h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\ell C,A)\\quad\\bigl((i(h)\\circ\\eta_{yC})_C(\\operatorname{id}_C)=b\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\Vdash_{M,\\vec z,\\beta}\\chi\\iff\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec z}(\\ell C,\\operatorname{Stage}_{C,M_{\\vec z}}(\\beta),\\chi),\\qquad\\beta|_f:=M_{\\vec z}(f)(\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\Vdash_{M,\\vec z,\\beta}\\chi\\iff\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec z}(\\ell C,\\operatorname{Stage}_{C,M_{\\vec z}}(\\beta),\\chi),\\qquad\\beta|_f:=M_{\\vec z}(f)(\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x,\\alpha}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\iff\\exists S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\quad\\bigl(f\\in S\\Rightarrow(D\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x,\\alpha|_f}\\varphi\\vee D\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x,\\alpha|_f}\\psi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x,\\alpha}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\iff\\exists S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\quad\\bigl(f\\in S\\Rightarrow(D\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x,\\alpha|_f}\\varphi\\vee D\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x,\\alpha|_f}\\psi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x,\\alpha}(\\exists x:s\\,\\theta)\\iff\\exists S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\quad\\bigl(f\\in S\\Rightarrow\\exists b\\in M_s(D)\\quad D\\Vdash_{M,(\\vec x,x),(\\alpha|_f,b)}\\theta\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\Vdash_{M,\\vec x,\\alpha}(\\exists x:s\\,\\theta)\\iff\\exists S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\quad\\bigl(f\\in S\\Rightarrow\\exists b\\in M_s(D)\\quad D\\Vdash_{M,(\\vec x,x),(\\alpha|_f,b)}\\theta\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 VI.6 的站点形式。覆盖筛对应 ℓD→ℓC 的联合满射族；层满射的局部可提升性将<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"2244a38da8fc05f8\" href=\"?note=2244a38da8fc05f8\" title=\"14-thm-kripke-joyal-forcing-rules\">14-thm-kripke-joyal-forcing-rules</a>的满覆盖见证转换为站点上的覆盖筛。未假设站点次典范：阶段用 a(yC)，避免把非层的原始可表预层直接当层范畴对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0d0e27d414f41634","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-yoneda-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"1291f8efcdef81cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-yoneda-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-s